  {
   "id": "redo-114085@major-2019-07-08",
   "gameId": "redo-114085",
   "displayName": "new update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-07-08T02:55:38.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey! the new mode is finally here! There will be some bugs, but i'm working right now to get things fixed. To access the new mode, first you need to finish the normal campaing, then the \"new game+\" option will be available.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The main point of this mode it to offer a \"second run\" with a different level design and some few dialogues and enemies. It's nothing mind blowing, but if you liked the normal campaing, well now you have something \"new\" to play haha.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's something i would like to see in more games, to be honest. With some changes in the level design and enemy position you can create a lot of interesting new situations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I'm still balancing things, so you may find some sections almost impossible, but i'll keep working on it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "what next?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "now, i'll keep polishing this mode and fix some old bugs that i ignored until now. you can expect daily updates. Next thing will be the full release. After all the major bugs and balacing issues are solved i will probably create a new trailer and then release the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Well, thats it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "enjoy!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "**** I had some problens with the italian translation in the hard mode, so it may take a few more days to the italian translation to be available. Sorry!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "but english and portuguese is fine!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
